  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"navbox\" style=\"border-spacing:0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px\"><table class=\"nowraplinks hlist collapsible &#123;&#123;&#123;state&#125;&#125;&#125; navbox-inner\" style=\"border-spacing:0;background:transparent;color:inherit\"><tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"navbox-title\" colspan=\"2\"><div class=\"plainlinks hlist navbar mini\"><ul><li class=\"nv-view\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span title=\"View this template\" style=\";;background:none transparent;border:none;\">v</span></strong></li><li class=\"nv-talk\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template talk:Organization infoboxes (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGVfdGFsazpPcmdhbml6YXRpb25faW5mb2JveGVzP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\" style=\";;background:none transparent;border:none;\">t</span></span></li><li class=\"nv-edit\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://second-renaissance.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Organization_infoboxes?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\" style=\";;background:none transparent;border:none;\">e</span></a></li></ul></div><div style=\"font-size:114%\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_messages\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Template messages\">Wikipedia templates</a>: <span class=\"new\" title=\"Organization (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvT3JnYW5pemF0aW9uP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">organization</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Template:Infobox\" title=\"Template:Infobox\">infoboxes</a></div></th></tr><tr style=\"height:2px\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"navbox-abovebelow\" colspan=\"2\"><div><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manual_of_Style/Infoboxes\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Manual of Style/Infoboxes\">Wikipedia:Manual of Style/Infoboxes</a></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:2px\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\">Main</th><td class=\"navbox-list navbox-odd\" style=\"text-align:left;border-left-width:2px;border-left-style:solid;width:100%;padding:0px\"><div style=\"padding:0em 0.25em\">\n<ul><li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:2px\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\"><div style=\"padding:0.1em 0;line-height:1.2em;\">Typically<br />non-profit</div></th><td class=\"navbox-list navbox-even\" style=\"text-align:left;border-left-width:2px;border-left-style:solid;width:100%;padding:0px\"><div style=\"padding:0em 0.25em\">\n<ul><li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"><sup><small>1</small></sup></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"><sup><small>2</small></sup></div></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:2px\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\">Business</th><td class=\"navbox-list navbox-odd\" style=\"text-align:left;border-left-width:2px;border-left-style:solid;width:100%;padding:0px\"><div style=\"padding:0em 0.25em\">\n<ul><li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:2px\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\"><div style=\"padding:0.1em 0;line-height:1.2em;\">Government<br />and politics</div></th><td class=\"navbox-list navbox-even\" style=\"text-align:left;border-left-width:2px;border-left-style:solid;width:100%;padding:0px\"><div style=\"padding:0em 0.25em\">\n<ul><li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:2px\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\">Publications</th><td class=\"navbox-list navbox-odd\" style=\"text-align:left;border-left-width:2px;border-left-style:solid;width:100%;padding:0px\"><div style=\"padding:0em 0.25em\">\n<ul><li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:2px\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\">Subtemplates</th><td class=\"navbox-list navbox-even\" style=\"text-align:left;border-left-width:2px;border-left-style:solid;width:100%;padding:0px\"><div style=\"padding:0em 0.25em\">\n<ul><li><b>Address</b>&#160;<div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><b>Coordinates</b>&#160;<div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><span class=\"wrap\"><b>Dates</b><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">&#160;&#160;</span>Use <div style=\"clear:both\"> if the organization has an \"established\", \"founded\", \"opened\" or similar date. Use <div style=\"clear:both\"> if the organization is defunct (dissolved or absorbed).</div></div></span></li>\n<li><b>Microformat&#160;/&#32;metadata</b>&#160;<div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><b>Non-English text</b>&#160;<div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><b>Website</b>&#160;<div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:2px\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"navbox-abovebelow\" colspan=\"2\"><div>\n<ul><li><sup><small>1</small></sup> or research institutions</li>\n<li><sup><small>2</small></sup> or college</li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Infobox_templates\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Infobox templates\">Category</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Infobox\" title=\"Help:Infobox\">Help</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_infoboxes\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:List of infoboxes\">List of infoboxes</a></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"article-table\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr style=\"font-size:18px;\">\n<th>Template documentation follows\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i>Note: the template above may sometimes be partially or fully invisible.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Visit <a href=\"/wiki/Template:Organization_infoboxes/doc\" title=\"Template:Organization infoboxes/doc\">Template:Organization_infoboxes/doc</a> to edit this documentation. (<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Documentation\" title=\"Template:Documentation\">How does this work?</a>)\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div style=\"margin:0 1em;\">\n<table class=\"vertical-navbox nowraplinks plainlist collapsible\" style=\"float:right;clear:right;width:22.0em;margin:0 0 1.0em 1.0em;background:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #aaa;padding:0.2em;border-spacing:0.4em 0;text-align:center;line-height:1.4em;font-size:88%;width:auto;background:#f5faff;font-size:90%;line-height:1.6em;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\"background:#cee0f2;;padding:0.2em 0.4em 0.2em;font-size:145%;line-height:1.2em;font-size:130%;padding-left:0.4em;padding-right:0.4em; display:block;margin-bottom:6px; font-size:100%;padding:0.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:130%;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WikiProject_Infoboxes\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:WikiProject Infoboxes\">WikiProject Infoboxes</a></span></th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0.1em 0.4em;padding-top:0.15em;\">\n<span style=\"position:relative; bottom:0.25em;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_infoboxes\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:List of infoboxes\">List of infoboxes</a></span></td>\n</tr><tr><th style=\"padding:0.1em;background:#cee0f2;;padding:0.1em 0.25em 0.15em;font-size:105%;\">\nStyle and help</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0.1em 0.4em;padding-top:0.15em;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manual_of_Style/Infoboxes\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Manual of Style/Infoboxes\">Manual of Style/Infoboxes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Infobox\" title=\"Help:Infobox\">Help:Infobox</a></li></ul></td>\n</tr><tr><th style=\"padding:0.1em;background:#cee0f2;;padding:0.1em 0.25em 0.15em;font-size:105%;\">\nCleanup</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0.1em 0.4em;padding-top:0.15em;\">\n<table class=\"vertical-navbox nowraplinks\" style=\"float:right;clear:right;width:22.0em;margin:0 0 1.0em 1.0em;background:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #aaa;padding:0.2em;border-spacing:0.4em 0;text-align:center;line-height:1.4em;font-size:88%;&#91;&#91;:Template:Subsidebar bodystyle&#93;&#93;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\"padding:0.1em\">\nTalk page</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0.1em 0.4em\">\n<ul><li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li></ul></td>\n</tr><tr><th style=\"padding:0.1em\">\nArticle</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0.1em 0.4em\">\n<ul><li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li></ul></td>\n</tr></tbody></table></td>\n</tr><tr><th style=\"padding:0.1em;background:#cee0f2;;padding:0.1em 0.25em 0.15em;font-size:105%;\">\nBuilding</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0.1em 0.4em;padding-top:0.15em;\">\n<ul><li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_infoboxes/Proposed\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:List of infoboxes/Proposed\">List of infoboxes/Proposed</a></li></ul></td>\n</tr><tr><th style=\"padding:0.1em;background:#cee0f2;;padding:0.1em 0.25em 0.15em;font-size:105%;\">\nTo do</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0.1em 0.4em;padding-top:0.15em;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Wikipedia articles with an infobox request (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6V2lraXBlZGlhX2FydGljbGVzX3dpdGhfYW5faW5mb2JveF9yZXF1ZXN0P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Add infobox</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Pages needing an infobox conversion (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6UGFnZXNfbmVlZGluZ19hbl9pbmZvYm94X2NvbnZlcnNpb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Change template used</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Wikipedia infobox cleanup (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6V2lraXBlZGlhX2luZm9ib3hfY2xlYW51cD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Cleanup contents</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Templates_suitable_for_conversion_to_use_Template:Infobox\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Templates suitable for conversion to use Template:Infobox\">Convert to use {{Infobox}}</a></li></ul></td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:right;font-size:115%\"><div class=\"plainlinks hlist navbar mini\"><ul><li class=\"nv-view\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:WikiProject_Infoboxes_sidebar\" title=\"Template:WikiProject Infoboxes sidebar\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a></li><li class=\"nv-talk\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template talk:WikiProject Infoboxes sidebar (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGVfdGFsazpXaWtpUHJvamVjdF9JbmZvYm94ZXNfc2lkZWJhcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">t</span></span></li><li class=\"nv-edit\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://second-renaissance.fandom.com/wiki/Template:WikiProject_Infoboxes_sidebar?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></li></ul></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\">Usage</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Place <code>{{<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Organization infoboxes</strong>}}</code> on the very pages that it lists. (Check these here: <a href=\"/wiki/Special:WhatLinksHere/Template:Organization_infoboxes\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/Template:Organization infoboxes\">Special:WhatLinksHere/Template:Organization infoboxes</a>.)\n</p><p><b>How to manage this template's initial visibility</b><br />\nTo manage this template's visibility when it first appears, <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Template\" title=\"Help:Template\">add the parameter</a>:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><code class=\"nowrap\">&#124;state&#61;collapsed</code> to show the template in its collapsed state, i.e. hidden apart from its titlebar&#160;– e.g. <code>{{Organization infoboxes |state=collapsed}}</code></dd>\n<dd><code class=\"nowrap\">&#124;state&#61;expanded</code> to show the template in its expanded state, i.e. fully visible&#160;– e.g. <code>{{Organization infoboxes |state=expanded}}</code></dd>\n<dd><code class=\"nowrap\">&#124;state&#61;autocollapse</code> to show the template in its collapsed state <i>but only if</i> there is another template of the same type on the page&#160;– e.g. <code>{{Organization infoboxes |state=autocollapse}}</code></dd></dl>\n<p>Unless set otherwise (see the <code class=\"nowrap\">&#124;state&#61;</code> parameter in the template's code), the template's default state is <code>autocollapse</code>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><div style=\"clear:both\"></div></li></ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205518\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.106 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 701/1000000\nPo